 (<sup>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</sup>)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.452 (<sup>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</sup>)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.630 (<sup>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</sup>)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Rectum SOMA score</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.643 (<sup>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</sup>)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.760 (<sup>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</sup>)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.616 (<sup>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</sup>)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Vaizey score</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.452 (<sup>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</sup>)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.760 (<sup>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</sup>)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.599 (<sup>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</sup>)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Total IBDQ score</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.630 (<sup>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</sup>)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.616 (<sup>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</sup>)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.599 (<sup>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</sup>)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Significance level (two-tailed)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.001</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.001</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.001</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.001</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote13"><label/><p>IBDQ=Inflammatory Bowel Disease questionnaire; SOMA=Subjective, Objective, Management and Analytic;</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote14"><label>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</label><p>Correlation is significant at the 0.01 level (two-tailed).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>